# SBFB phase-auditor-gate bypass audit trail
#
# Format (one entry per bypass, append-only):
#   ISO-8601 timestamp | sprint/phase | commit SHA | justification
#
# Created: Sprint 22 Phase F (P2-S21-5 fix).
# Pattern: every use of NEXUS_SKIP_PHASE_AUDITOR=1 must append a
# line here with an inline justification. Entries are audited in
# the Phase 0 audit gate of the following sprint.
#
# Bypass is NOT a scope cut — it's a process escape hatch reserved
# for cases where the hook wrongly blocks a legitimate commit
# (false positive regex, infrastructure outage, etc.). If a hook
# true-positive is blocking, the correct response is to fix the
# code or produce the missing review.md, not bypass.
#
# Schema:
#   <ISO timestamp>\t<sprint>/<phase>\t<short SHA>\t<justification>
#
# Example:
#   2026-04-20T14:32:05Z	sprint22/F	690fab3	hook false-positive on doc-only phase, no code review needed
